{
  "_readme": [
    "This file is the whole personality of Finstagram. Edit it to add, remove or reweight interests.",
    "Each topic: id (short slug), name, emoji (used as the story/avatar icon), gradient (two CSS colours),",
    "weight (relative share of the 40 slots), optional boost (keywords that push matching posts up),",
    "and feeds. A feed is a URL string, or an object { url, name, include: [keywords] } where include",
    "keeps only items whose title or summary mention one of the keywords (handy for broad feeds).",
    "Dead feeds are skipped with a warning; nothing breaks.",
    "cards: apps to be nudged towards. Each has a url, cta and a list of messages; one message is picked",
    "per build and dropped into the feed as a practice card near the top.",
    "wildcards: extra interests that sit between two of the topics above (between: [id, id]). One is drawn",
    "at random every build and gets `slots` posts, so the feed has a small surprise in it each time."
  ],
  "postCount": 40,
  "maxAgeDays": 21,
